WEBVTT

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.600
Wow!

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.700
It's the beach! Yippee!

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:17.490
So much water! Awesome!

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.640
It feels so good!

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.580
The water isn't cold at all!

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.250
Ice

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.570
Beach House

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.570
Warm Showers
 Changing Rooms
 Lockers

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.630
Seriously?

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.490
This is a beach house.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:41.040
Not bad, right? This is a 
military welfare facility.

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:44.980
I don't mind, as long as I'm with Taito.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.550
Worthless.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:51.730
It's your fault that we're even here.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.240
What? You're putting 
all the blame on me?

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.200
That's true.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.660
Kurogane-kun's grades look quite dismal

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:02.440
when compared to those of the 
good student Kurenai-kun.

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:10.250
But Kurenai-kun has no other 
redeeming qualities to speak of.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:21.720
See what I mean? That won't do.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.770
That's why we need this training camp.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:29.770
Let's get started.

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:34.530
Time to whip Miyasaka High School 
student council into shape!

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:20.870
"The Student Council 
of Remedial Students"

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:22.630
Hey, Gekkou. Don't you think it's weird?

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.390
We're on this beautiful beach and 
there isn't another soul in sight.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:26.870
Yeah.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:30.930
It makes sense. There's a 
barrier to keep people away.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:35.850
Ordinary humans will 
unconsciously stay away.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:39.710
The spell seems to be a military one.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:42.870
You're sharp. Must be 
because you're a vampire.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:46.510
The barrier protects civilians 
from any unfortunate accidents.

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:49.290
Then why is she here?!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.770
Isn't Aomi Izumi a civilian?!

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.920
I appreciate it. Summer 
vacation hasn't even started,

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.300
and I've already been 
invited to the beach.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:03.260
That's because Kurogane-kun screwed 
up and let Aomi-san blackmail him.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:07.060
He had to get Aomi-san into the student 
council or his secret would be revealed.

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:10.810
And you're telling me that the 
military caved in to her demands?

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.390
Yes, we did.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.520
Is something wrong with that?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.650
Bastard...

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:23.940
Besides, I have a feeling that 
Aomi-san will be very useful.

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.180
She'd make a perfect secretary.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:30.660
Yep, yep. I'm actually good 
at staying on a tight budget.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:32.270
Rubbish.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:37.710
You should follow orders.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:40.730
Damage was kept to a minimum 
because of my presence.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.380
You incompetents should 
stay out of my affairs.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.550
Incompetents, you say?

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.770
And you're dead.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.990
Damn!

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:57.230
No way!

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:05.070
That won't work against me.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.550
Brat.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.770
Gekkou!

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:23.500
Don't get so worked up. You're 
just a brat in high school.

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:27.800
No need to feel ashamed about 
letting me beat you up.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.780
You should be proud.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.600
The military feels that you're doing

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.180
a much better job as the student 
council president than I ever did.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.040
You were the student council president?

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.440
I was once in your shoes. 
Show some respect.

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:45.100
The military has high hopes for you.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:50.550
Since it's been a while since the last 
child who had as much power as I did.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.200
Shut up, I won't listen 
to your drivel...

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.580
You will, because in this world,

00:05:56.140 --> 00:06:00.050
the weak obey the strong.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.580
Look, Gekkou!

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.180
This should taste good!

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:10.220
Is this edible?

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.240
You can eat it for all I care.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:13.800
What?! Hold on, Gekkou!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.110
Stay away, scum. You're 
getting my clothes wet.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:18.280
Hey! Come on, Gekkou!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.800
Good grief. This will be a long camp.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:22.820
Taito.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.030
Himea? Why are you crying...

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.370
I'm smiling!

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.830
I love you, Taito.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.390
What's this?

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:54.350
Holding each other while standing in 
the ocean? Isn't that a little Hollywood?

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.900
Haruka's cooking is so good.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:07.780
Haruka will make a wonderful wife.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:10.420
Ah, I envy Kurogane-kun.

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:12.440
What? It's not like that...

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:14.440
Kurogane-kun has that special 
remedial class, right?

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:16.540
Yep, he's with Gekkou-sama.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:19.910
Man, summer vacation hasn't even 
started yet. I'm so jealous.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.620
That's true...

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:24.030
Anyway,

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:27.420
you've made a little progress with 
Kurogane-kun the past few days.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.520
A little? They're all over each other!

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:30.720
Thanks.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:40.770
I guess he's finally ready 
to take responsibility.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:43.160
It won't be long before 
you walk the aisle.

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:46.190
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.880
No! I won't let Kurogane have her!

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.810
Shigure Haruka is my wife!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.340
Okay, here are the room assignments.

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:05.460
1st floor - Kurenai Gekkou, Kurogane Taito
2nd floor - Saito Himea, Aomi Izumi, Andou Mirai

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:06.020
What?! I'm not with Gekkou?!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.910
Let's have fun, Andou-san.

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.640
You'll want to hear this.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:11.960
Even if you're in separate rooms...

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:17.390
Hey, Gekkou! Why would you sneak into 
my room in the middle of the night?

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:18.890
Rubbish.

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:21.390
We're going to be separated, Taito?

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.240
Well, yeah... We can't 
stay in the same room.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:31.990
Say, do you really have 
to wear your uniform?

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.990
It's none of your concern. 
I'm not like you trash.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.180
Get out...

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.410
Medicine - Aomi Izumi

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:45.240
Bouncy bed!

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:46.630
Is that the current fashion?

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.190
Yeah, more or less.

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:50.640
I don't get too many chances 
to wear something like this.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.120
You have to enjoy 
yourself while you can.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:54.630
Maybe I should get changed.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.480
That's a useful spell.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:06.900
I wonder if Taito will like this.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.350
Don't worry!

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:12.320
Kurogane-kun will love you in anything.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.370
Mr. Kurosu?

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.260
What was that for?!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.970
Are you an enemy?!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.350
Yeah, way too slow.

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:42.150
You should have been on your guard the 
second you sensed my hostile intent.

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:45.600
I'd grade your spontaneous 
emergency response as...

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.140
7 points.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.430
Okay, you made the wrong decision.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.910
You don't know how fast a 
piece of chalk can move?

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:57.760
I'm stronger than you are.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.820
A spontaneous emergency 
response score of 12 points.

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:01.200
Bastard!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.150
And your movement is sluggish.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:05.240
You can't protect anyone like that.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.000
0 points for  illusion resistance.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.300
Illusion...?

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:22.470
I see. So your grades aren't 
the only thing that need work.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:26.190
Th-That was all an illusion...?

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.630
You're damn strong.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:33.110
So if you train me, I 
can become stronger?

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:35.870
100 points for drive.

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:39.990
Eager kids like you can 
quickly become stronger.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:46.380
Could you stop doing that?

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.870
What do you mean?

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:52.380
Oh, you mean how I was 
testing Kurogane-kun?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:55.280
I don't know who you are,

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:59.880
but do you really think I'll let 
a human live after hurting Taito?

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.050
Now, now. Hold on a second.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:05.260
I'm helping to educate Kurogane-kun.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.400
That won't be necessary!

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:22.390
Did you enjoy that illusion?

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:24.990
Not bad.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:28.330
You're not human, are you?

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.170
I'm human.

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:31.540
In appearance, perhaps.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:34.170
Appearance is all that 
matters to humans.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:41.840
Oh? It appears that this is the range 
where your magic is most effective.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.260
What's your point?

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:46.500
But that would require a bodyguard.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:50.640
Which means you'll need Kurogane-kun 
to be somewhat usable.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:56.750
You can't kill me with any of 
your instant low-level spells.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:59.010
And Kurogane-kun isn't strong enough

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:01.180
to serve as a bodyguard yet.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.450
Which means...

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:06.230
I can kill you and Kurogane Taito,

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.380
but you can't kill me.

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:09.080
So...

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:12.500
You'll need him to become stronger.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:14.770
But unfortunately,

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:18.940
you aren't capable of training 
Kurogane-kun to become stronger.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.630
How would you know?

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.370
I know.

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:27.920
Because it will require 
him to become less human.

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:30.370
Don't worry.

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:33.000
I'm good at teaching other people.

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:35.270
After all, I am a teacher.

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:54.500
Hmm, we're not going to run out of food.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:57.310
Izumi, did you see any ice?

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:58.200
Ice?

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:00.350
Sure, why do you ask?

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.170
Let's shave it up good!

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:04.130
Shave it up good?

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:09.200
How do you even know about this stuff?

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:10.670
I saw it on TV!

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:14.050
Um, you want the blue, the 
red, and the yellow, right?

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:15.340
The traffic light special?!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:17.160
Here.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.800
Yay!

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.030
Taito.

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:26.000
Um, how do I look?

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.110
Do you like it?

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:30.300
Y-Yeah...

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:33.310
It's really cute.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:34.510
Really?

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.770
I'm glad.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:42.080
Brain freeze!

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.860
Looks like everybody's settled in.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:48.540
Let's start training then.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:52.610
The purpose of this camp

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:56.710
is to improve your combat capacity 
by a significant amount.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:59.140
Significant amount? How 
much are we talking about?

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:00.670
Let's see...

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:04.980
By next year, you should be strong 
enough to defeat a Gedgard.

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:09.120
What's a Gedgard?

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.550
A Gedgard...

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.980
Also known as an ancient dragon.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:13.880
A primal wyrm.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:17.140
Ooh, sounds like something 
out of an RPG.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:19.270
It's not that simple.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:22.810
Primal wyrms are on a different level 
from your average demon or spirit.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:25.300
You might want to consider them gods.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.500
Gods?

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.390
Why are you so scared?

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:32.610
One of the student council's 
duties is to slay primal wyrms.

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:36.270
Though it was only possible

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:39.370
when I was the student 
council president.

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:44.400
Do you mean to say that 
you can't handle it?

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:46.900
It's too easy.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.070
See, there's that look again.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:54.890
You keep forgetting that you're 
just a weak brat who's got guts.

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:57.270
That's the first problem 
you need to fix.

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:59.400
Gekkou isn't weak!

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.430
You're a diamond in the rough

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:07.090
who has the potential to completely 
control the holy land.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:11.930
So we can't let you accidentally 
die because you're still weak.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.840
And I forgot to mention something.

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:20.080
You'll all be tested at 
the end of this camp.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.970
If you don't pass the test,

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:26.820
you won't be allowed to pass through 
the barrier around this place.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.370
Keep that in mind.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:32.570
No way! You're supposed to 
tell us before we start!

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:35.580
Sorry, I have a bad memory.

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:40.670
Does that mean I also have to 
pass a test before I can leave?

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:44.600
Now that you're a member of the student 
council, that would be the requirement.

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:47.400
But I'm an ordinary human.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.860
Don't worry.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.890
The military would prefer that

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:54.600
you be stuck here forever.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.690
That's pretty selfish.

00:15:56.690 --> 00:16:00.230
Okay! Kurenai-kun, Mirai-chan, 
Himea-san, and Kurogane-kun!

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:02.830
I'll be rooting for 
you, so hang in there!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.860
Are you an idiot?

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.820
Ooh, that's a cool illusion!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:17.080
This will be a basic lesson, but 
you'll die if you aren't careful.

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:20.370
Ah, please don't go in, Saito-san.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:24.080
Well, you're already 
strong enough, I'd say.

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:25.600
But...

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:27.700
Don't worry, Himea.

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:28.900
Taito...

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:30.590
I'll go give it a twirl.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:31.990
Let's go.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:52.780
This is...

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:54.720
Huh, funny place.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.740
Stay on your guard.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:59.740
Welcome to my classroom.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.100
8 points.

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:05.950
You're still slow to react.

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:09.320
That was dirty... No warning?

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:11.880
Ew, you really are immortal.

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:15.300
Take cover, you idiot!

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:20.290
And the president is quite the feminist.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:24.190
Are you serious about killing 
Aomi to keep her quiet?

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:27.010
That was just a joke.

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:29.080
I won't hurt Aomi-san.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:33.050
In return, she's required 
to watch your training.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.240
So I'm a spectator?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.050
Then I'll do just that.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.310
Good luck, everyone!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:40.990
Mirai, come!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.280
Wait, Gekkou!

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:44.950
He's our enemy. Dispose of him.

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.330
The curse is lifted!

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:54.380
Time for a fully charged Andu-Mirai!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.490
Can I kill him?

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:58.550
Go ahead! Finish him!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:02.390
Okay! Zap away!

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:03.210
Take that!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:05.730
Did you get him?!

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.070
Mirai!

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:17.550
Kurenai-kun is weak to attacks in the 
third dimension that move up and down.

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:21.990
And Spell Error is a defensive weapon 
that can only be used at close range.

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:26.620
You use Andu-Mirai as a long-range 
weapon to nullify that weakness.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:29.490
Not bad for a little brat.

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:30.500
Bastard...

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:34.630
Unfortunately, you're both 
too weak at this point.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:35.600
Nonsense!

00:18:36.980 --> 00:18:38.370
Slow as molasses.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:42.670
Dammit...

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:46.930
Well, that should be 
enough of a warm-up.

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:52.120
Let's move onto the main event.

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:57.780
Making yourself comfortable?

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:01.360
A familiar is enough to 
handle Taito and the others?

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:05.820
If I used my full strength, I'd kill 
them before they learned anything.

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:09.810
You aren't human, are you?

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.400
Does it really matter?

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:18.380
Anyway, they should be returning soon.

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.400
Dammit...

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:24.270
Taito!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.660
I'm back...

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.720
I'm so relieved!

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:31.230
Don't worry. Humans are 
always improving.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:34.750
Eventually, humans will 
be able to kill gods.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:39.950
I'm sure you know what that means.

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:51.690
Hey, this is good!

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:54.840
There's plenty more left. My curry 
is the best recipe in my repertoire.

00:19:58.060 --> 00:19:59.620
Gekkou...

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:11.260
Curry for breakfast?!

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:14.020
Curry tastes great after 
you let it sit overnight.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.060
This can't be real...

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:38.770
Are you seriously telling us to eat 
curry three meals a day every single day?

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.270
That's weird.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.380
I was planning on making 
pork cutlets today.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:46.680
Curry isn't your best recipe, is 
it? It's the only one you know!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.140
I aced my home ec exam,

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.840
but I have trouble 
applying that knowledge.

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:53.750
I wasn't expecting this to happen.

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:59.460
Yes, hello? Suzae-san?

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:02.400
Sorry, I have a favor to ask.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.720
There!

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:23.140
This is unusual. Mr. Kurosu 
is letting us take a break.

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:24.300
Stay on your guard.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:28.790
That accursed Kurosu must 
be plotting something.

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:30.150
Probably.

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:31.560
Taito.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:32.680
Cold!

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:34.970
Hey.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:37.660
There's a gorgeous cliff over there.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:38.680
Let's go see it together.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:39.990
A cliff?

00:21:42.810 --> 00:21:46.060
The two of us alone 
on a cliff sounds kinda...

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:49.940
You don't want to see the cliff with me?

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:51.940
Th-That's not it!

00:21:52.670 --> 00:21:54.970
Let's go together then!

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:56.850
Taito?

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:05.750
Haruka...?

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:09.730
Taito, I'm here.

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:12.960
Ha-Haruka...?

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:14.970
Wh-Why...

00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:29.110
What about you, Taito? 
What are you doing here?

00:22:29.570 --> 00:22:31.990
I'm training, I guess...

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:34.990
You call this training?

00:24:11.050 --> 00:24:13.550
Okay! Hello, everyone.

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:15.900
I'm the only normal person in 
this student council of freaks.

00:24:15.900 --> 00:24:19.500
Aomi Izumi-chan, represent!

00:24:19.500 --> 00:24:21.550
Anyway, moving on.

00:24:21.550 --> 00:24:24.980
This is the season for ice cream.

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:27.040
And so...

00:24:27.040 --> 00:24:31.050
My skirt is so short, I get a 
tummy ache when I eat ice cream!

00:24:31.050 --> 00:24:31.990
The end.

00:24:32.580 --> 00:24:35.490
Will my story continue next week?

00:24:35.490 --> 00:24:36.720
As if.

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:39.990
Next Time: "Dark Rabbit on the Beach"

00:24:36.720 --> 00:24:38.460
Not that it really matters.
